  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mainstreaming Energy Efficiency in MSME buildings in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to promote energy efficiency and conservation among MSMEs in the Philippines. The project has three main outputs: 1) Situation analysis on potential for energy efficiency in MSMEs; 2) Identification of MSMEs buildings and walk-through energy audits; 3) Business case or investment proposal developed for energy efficiency project in selected MSMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
